{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-07-11 16:05:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ JUNE 2022 VOLUMES AND 2Q22 STATISTICS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JULY 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ (NASDAQ: NDAQ) TODAY REPORTED MONTHLY VOLUMES FOR JUNE 2022, AS WELL AS QUARTERLY VOLUMES, ESTIMATED REVENUE CAPTURE, NUMBER OF LISTINGS AND INDEX STATISTICS FOR THE QUARTER ENDED JUNE 30, 2022 ON ITS INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE. A DATA SHEET SHOWING THE MONTHLY VOLUMES AND QUARTERLY CAPTURE RATES CAN BE FOUND AT: HTTP://IR.NASDAQ.COM/FINANCIALS/VOLUME-STATISTICS.'}